Package: MultiOmicsCancer
Title: Integrative Multi-Omics Analysis for Pan-Cancer Research
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Maryam", "Emami", , "Maryam.emami1499@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0008-7710-3274"))
Description: A modular and cancer-agnostic framework for integrative
    analysis of multi-omics data in cancer research. The package provides
    tools for differential methylation analysis, gene expression analysis,
    miRNA profiling, multi-omics integration, survival analysis, and
    biomarker discovery. It supports data from TCGA, cBioPortal, GEO, and
    user-provided datasets, and is designed to work across any cancer type.
